layer	turbo:parse-texts	document	42	sample:u32	text:str
0	The cat sat on the mat .
1	The dog slept under the table .
2	Anna 's brother baked a cake .
3	`` The soup is cold , '' she said .
4	The children played in the garden .
5	Tom bought three apples ( all red ) .
6	Is the kettle hot ?
7	Close the door !
8	The cat on the roof watched the birds .
9	We walked to the market in the morning .
10	The sun rose , and the birds sang .
11	Maria likes tea .
12	It rained all day .
13	Good morning !
14	the baker 's oven broke .
15	Sam gave the dog a bone .
16	The train arrived late .
17	He smiled , waving his hand .
18	The garden ( Anna 's ) needs water .
19	Birds fly over the river near the town .
20	What did you see ?
21	I heard that the shop closed .
22	The soup , the bread , and the cheese were fresh .
23	`` We are ready , '' Tom said .
24	The old man read a book by the window .
25	Anna , the baker , laughed .
26	They will visit the museum .
27	The rain stopped before the game began .
28	She found the key under Tom 's coat .
29	The dog barked and ran .
30	Look at the sky !
31	about ten people came .
32	The kettle boiled quickly .
33	We ate bread and cheese ( again ) .
34	Tea tastes good .
35	The cats slept on the sofa after lunch .
36	Tom asked , `` is it late ? ''
37	The wind blew hard .
38	I cooked ; she cleaned .
39	The baker sold two loaves of bread .
40	Wait
41	A cup of tea .
end	turbo:parse-texts
